      "id": "slice-2-five-tool-map",
      "title": "五把扫描工具：看定性、测强度、追隐喻、抬预设、追主语",
      "blocks": [
       {
        "id": "c31-five-tool-map",
        "html": "<style>.head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;align-items:end;padding-bottom:12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--course-border)}.head p{margin:0;color:var(--course-muted)}.tools{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:9px;margin:18px 0}.tool{padding:13px;border:1px solid var(--course-border);border-radius:var(--course-radius);background:var(--course-surface)}.tool:nth-child(2),.tool:nth-child(4){background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--course-accent-weak) 55%,var(--course-surface))}.n{display:block;color:var(--course-accent);font-size:28px;font-weight:850}.tool h3{margin:7px 0 5px;font-size:17px}.tool p{margin:0;color:var(--course-muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.55}.rewrite{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--course-border);border-radius:var(--course-radius)}.rewrite section{padding:11px;background:var(--course-accent-weak);border-radius:var(--course-radius)}.arrow{color:var(--course-accent);font-size:25px;font-weight:800}.mistakes{margin-top:14px;padding:13px 15px;border-left:4px solid var(--course-accent);background:var(--course-accent-weak)}.mistakes strong{display:block;margin-bottom:5px}@media(max-width:860px){.tools{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}@media(max-width:620px){.tools,.rewrite{grid-template-columns:1fr}.arrow{text-align:center;transform:rotate(90deg)}}</style><div class=\"head\"><div><small>方法学习 · 五工具全图</small><h2>把“听起来有倾向”拆成五个可定位入口</h2></div><p>刚才：感受镜头差异<br>现在：获得扫描工具<br>接下来：看完整示范</p></div><div class=\"tools\" aria-label=\"五把语言扫描工具\"><section class=\"tool\"><span class=\"n\">01</span><h3>看定性</h3><p>哪些词先为事件贴上性质和价值标签？</p></section><section class=\"tool\"><span class=\"n\">02</span><h3>测强度</h3><p>委婉、淡化、夸张或加重怎样调节严重程度？</p></section><section class=\"tool\"><span class=\"n\">03</span><h3>追隐喻</h3><p>问题被映射成什么？这条轨道引向什么行动？</p></section><section class=\"tool\"><span class=\"n\">04</span><h3>抬预设</h3><p>哪项前提被偷塞进句子？它能否被明确否定？</p></section><section class=\"tool\"><span class=\"n\">05</span><h3>追主语</h3><p>谁做了什么？责任是否因被动或模糊主语消失？</p></section></div><section class=\"rewrite\"><section><strong>事实底稿</strong><p>先写对象、动作、后果、来源和仍待核实之处。</p></section><div class=\"arrow\">→</div><section><strong>重述比较</strong><p>保留事实完成重述，再说明前后判断路径怎样变化。</p></section></section><aside class=\"mistakes\"><strong>三项边界提醒</strong>指出具体词和机制；不要把重述写成模糊责任；被动句只有在隐藏关键行动者时才是问题。扫描单由定性、强度、隐喻、预设、主语、重述比较六栏组成。</aside>",
